/**
Day 95 – CRUD Operations

Task:

Insert, find, update, delete
👉 Practice:
Create users collection
*/


SQL vs MongoDB CRUD
SQL	    MongoDB
INSERT	insertOne()
SELECT	find()
UPDATE	updateOne()
DELETE	deleteOne()

Engineering Use Cases
CRUD is used in every software system:
User management
Banking apps
E-commerce
Social media
Student portals

Examples:
Register user → Insert
Login → Find
Edit profile → Update
Delete account → Delete

                      USING MONGODB SHELL
db.users.insertOne({
  name: "shivam",
  age: 21
})

db.users.find()

db.users.updateOne(
  { name: "shivam" },
  { $set: { age: 22 } }
)

db.users.deleteOne({ name: "shivam" })